1
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:15,420
Dad, please stop drinking.

2
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:18,970
Don't ask for a beating!

3
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:22,120
Dad, Dad, Dad!

4
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:24,340
Just die!

5
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,170
I'll kill you!

6
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:52,520
Sir.

7
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:01,410
Well, hello there, beautiful.

8
00:01:02,490 --> 00:01:04,920
Come here.

9
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:12,520
Help!

10
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:15,460
He's trying to hurt me!

11
00:01:16,610 --> 00:01:17,610
Somebody help!

12
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,700
What are you doing?

13
00:01:29,789 --> 00:01:32,240
[Dearest Episode 1]

14
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:35,950
[8 Years Later]

15
00:01:37,509 --> 00:01:39,580
[Xinggang City, Pacific Coast]

16
00:01:44,289 --> 00:01:47,400
[Wen Group Heiress, Superstar Wen Jianan]

17
00:02:13,910 --> 00:02:16,079
[Owner of Cloudsea Club, Alex]

18
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,150
Good evening, sir!

19
00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:35,910
Wen Jianan.

20
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:37,840
Superstar Wen Jianan

21
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:40,310
has announced her marriage tonight
to rising actor Chen Xingye

22
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:42,440
after three years of dating in secret.

23
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:44,100
Being a wealthy family's
son-in-law isn't easy.

24
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:46,550
Whether Chen Xingye quits show business
after the wedding

25
00:02:46,550 --> 00:02:48,280
has become the talk of the town.

26
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:54,140
[Wen Jianan's Mother, Wen Xin]

27
00:02:57,030 --> 00:02:57,540
Sir.

28
00:02:57,820 --> 00:02:59,380
Mrs. Wen has spent 5.8 million

29
00:02:59,380 --> 00:03:00,790
in the Seaview Suite.

30
00:03:01,020 --> 00:03:02,670
Her card was frozen,

31
00:03:02,690 --> 00:03:04,550
so the transaction was declined.

32
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:08,100
What a joke.

33
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,480
You think I can't afford this?

34
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:12,030
Listen up.

35
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:14,310
Open your most exclusive suite,

36
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:16,030
the Cloudview Suite.

37
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:17,510
And

38
00:03:18,110 --> 00:03:20,430
get your boss, Alex,

39
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:21,740
down here.

40
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:22,760
And not just him.

41
00:03:23,410 --> 00:03:25,770
Even if you bring
all seven of the top men here,

42
00:03:25,770 --> 00:03:27,370
I can still afford this bill.

43
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:34,900
She wants me, huh?

44
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:38,579
Good. I've been curious
about the Wen family.

45
00:03:39,070 --> 00:03:39,800
Let's go meet

46
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:43,660
the Wen family matriarch.

47
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,350
Alex.

48
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:56,250
It's not easy to get a minute with you.

49
00:03:56,650 --> 00:03:59,040
I had to book the Cloudview Suite
just to see you.

50
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,770
And now, who would've thought?

51
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:03,860
A measly 5-million bill

52
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,100
is all it took to get you out.

53
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:09,760
Had I known, I'd have caused
a little more trouble sooner.

54
00:04:10,540 --> 00:04:12,720
Mrs. Wen, you certainly have
a sense of humor.

55
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,040
We made sure

56
00:04:15,550 --> 00:04:17,029
to capture everything

57
00:04:17,260 --> 00:04:18,899
on the security footage.

58
00:04:19,990 --> 00:04:21,220
So what?

59
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:22,340
The Wen family...

60
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:24,240
I trust you've enjoyed your evening.

61
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,750
But I guess you don't know this yet.

62
00:04:25,750 --> 00:04:27,110
Your daughter just announced

63
00:04:27,110 --> 00:04:28,790
her May wedding.

64
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:30,740
Now picture tomorrow's headline:

65
00:04:31,670 --> 00:04:33,630
Wen Group matriarch,

66
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:36,700
superstar Wen Jianan's mother,

67
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:39,260
racks up a tab at the Cloudsea
and gets the police involved.

68
00:04:39,260 --> 00:04:40,020
That would certainly

69
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:42,350
upstage the bride and groom, wouldn't it?

70
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,220
The Cloudsea will give you

71
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:45,710
the respect you deserve.

72
00:04:45,820 --> 00:04:48,310
But even Mr. Wen has to give

73
00:04:48,730 --> 00:04:51,580
Police Commissioner Chen his due.

74
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:01,520
Hello?

75
00:05:01,550 --> 00:05:02,350
Wen Jianan.

76
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:06,020
Bring money to the Cloudsea. Now!

77
00:05:06,470 --> 00:05:07,790
Or I promise you,

78
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:09,510
your wedding is off.

79
00:05:09,510 --> 00:05:10,460
I already told you.

80
00:05:10,460 --> 00:05:12,340
If you need something,
contact my manager, Shang Yu.

81
00:05:12,340 --> 00:05:13,510
Leave me alone.

82
00:05:13,930 --> 00:05:15,420
What a great mom.

83
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:22,550
Shang Yu.

84
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,500
My mom owes money at the Cloudsea.

85
00:05:25,780 --> 00:05:27,420
Go pay it.

86
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,720
And clean up the mess.

87
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:30,410
I don't want this getting out.

88
00:05:31,070 --> 00:05:33,000
Use my personal account.

89
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:37,070
I'm going to my parents'
for my childhood photos.

90
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,670
We need them for the wedding.

91
00:05:40,030 --> 00:05:40,670
Okay.

92
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:40,390
[He Mu, matrilocal husband
of the Wen family]

93
00:07:33,670 --> 00:07:34,330
The police.

94
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,320
I need to call the police.

95
00:07:40,220 --> 00:07:41,280
Call the police...

96
00:07:49,990 --> 00:07:51,070
Good. Alright.

97
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:56,770
It's all taken care of.

98
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:59,340
The Cloudsea bill. Jianan's accident.

99
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:04,610
A fatal crash

100
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,870
occurred early this morning
on a mountain road outside the city.

101
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:08,510
A man driving a supercar

102
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:10,700
struck and killed a 48-year-old woman.

103
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:11,520
He lost control of the vehicle

104
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,960
and died at the scene.

105
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:14,820
Police identified him as Jie,

106
00:08:14,820 --> 00:08:17,220
a server at the city's renowned luxury club,

107
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,750
the Cloudsea Club.

108
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:21,480
The cause of death was reportedly
a fatal drug overdose.

109
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,080
Recently,

110
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:24,540
intimate photos of top star
Wen Jianan were leaked.

111
00:08:24,030 --> 00:08:27,190
[Top Star Wen Jianan's Scandal Photos Leak;
Fiancé Calls Off Engagement]

112
00:08:24,580 --> 00:08:26,140
The scandal has caused an uproar.

113
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:27,630
Her fiancé, Chen Xingye,

114
00:08:27,650 --> 00:08:29,340
issued a statement through his agency

115
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:30,380
claiming he knew nothing about the photos

116
00:08:30,380 --> 00:08:31,870
and calling off the engagement.

117
00:08:31,870 --> 00:08:34,340
Wen Jianan has suspended
all public appearances

118
00:08:34,340 --> 00:08:35,270
and disappeared from the public eye.

119
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:37,980
All of her unreleased dramas
have been confirmed to be recast,

120
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:40,220
and brands are terminating
their endorsement deals.

121
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:42,020
Her career is worth nothing now.

122
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:54,070
Why?

123
00:08:57,530 --> 00:08:59,980
[Morgue]

124
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,120
Mom...

125
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:26,670
I'll make them pay.

126
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:36,790
Sir, we know who did it.

127
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:39,030
Wen Jianan was driving

128
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:40,550
that night.

129
00:09:40,570 --> 00:09:42,140
She killed your mother.

130
00:09:42,620 --> 00:09:44,730
Jie was serving Wen Xin
at the club that night.

131
00:09:44,730 --> 00:09:47,130
He Mu, their live-in son-in-law,
blamed him,

132
00:09:47,130 --> 00:09:48,490
had him taken away,

133
00:09:48,510 --> 00:09:50,040
and made him take the fall.

134
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:52,080
Jie was their perfect scapegoat.

135
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:56,820
We'll kill Wen Jianan right now

136
00:09:57,350 --> 00:09:59,350
and make her pay for your mom and Jie!

137
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,310
Kill her?

138
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,840
That'd be letting them off too easy.

139
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:06,800
Letting Wen Jianan

140
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:08,750
and her entire family off too easy.

141
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:09,920
My mother's life

142
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,040
and Jie's life.

143
00:10:12,700 --> 00:10:13,580
To them,

144
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:16,380
those lives were just problems
money and power could erase.

145
00:10:16,380 --> 00:10:17,860
Death is the easy way out.

146
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:21,760
I'll take everything from them.

147
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:24,210
Everything they love.

148
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,120
And then,

149
00:10:30,920 --> 00:10:32,770
we'll all burn in hell together.
